stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Collecting
  Collecting --> EvidenceUnknown: missing page / mapping / active cohort
  EvidenceUnknown --> Collecting: reconcile source evidence
  Collecting --> Evaluated: complete frozen G + acknowledged analytical projection
  Evaluated --> WithinObservedEnvelope: all qualified counts within allowances
  Evaluated --> BreachRecorded: exact current or historical witness
  BreachRecorded --> InvestigationPending
  InvestigationPending --> ReviewReady: actual hosted context read + issue
  InvestigationPending --> ReviewOnly: investigator unavailable / ungrounded
  ReviewReady --> Rejected: human declines action
  ReviewReady --> ApprovedAwaitingNativeAction: exact revision / scope approved
  ApprovedAwaitingNativeAction --> Stale: evidence or scope revision changes
  Stale --> Collecting: re-evaluate and require new review
  ApprovedAwaitingNativeAction --> ApplyUnknown: native action reported / outcome unknown
  ApprovedAwaitingNativeAction --> VerificationPending: native rule evidence recorded
  ApplyUnknown --> VerificationPending: reconcile actual native rule state
  VerificationPending --> VerifiedMatchingRestriction: target refused + fresh control succeeds
  VerificationPending --> VerificationFailed: target succeeds / both fail / wrong scope
  VerificationPending --> VerificationUnknown: missing genuine outcome
  VerificationFailed --> ReviewReady: corrected concrete scope requires review
  VerificationUnknown --> VerificationPending: retry bounded fresh probes
  VerifiedMatchingRestriction --> RecoveryReview: human requests restoration
  VerifiedMatchingRestriction --> EvidenceDisputed: late integrity conflict / changed dependent evidence
  EvidenceDisputed --> ReviewOnly: preserve effect receipt / operator re-evaluates scope
  RecoveryReview --> RecoveryVerificationPending: reviewed removal + native readback
  RecoveryVerificationPending --> RestoredMatchingCapability: fresh target AND control expected results
  RecoveryVerificationPending --> RecoveryFailed: either expected operation fails
  RecoveryVerificationPending --> RecoveryUnknown: genuine result missing
  RecoveryUnknown --> RecoveryVerificationPending: reconcile / bounded fresh probes
  RecoveryFailed --> RecoveryReview: review corrected restoration scope
  note right of WithinObservedEnvelope
    Provisional for captured finite cohort.
    No finality / global-safe / malicious-intent claim.
  end note
  note right of VerifiedMatchingRestriction
    Verified at observed time for matching calls.
    No in-flight rollback or universal sandbox.
    Aging count never automatically removes policy.
  end note
  note right of EvidenceDisputed
    Do not erase the historical effect receipt.
    Do not automatically remove the native DENY.
    Its supporting case now requires new review.
  end note
